  <trk>
    <name>Dean Castle countrypark, Fenwick, Craufurdland.</name>
    <desc>Walk from Dean Castle car park, through the estate to the Borland, onto Glasgow Road and walk to Fenwick. Turn right down Waterslap to the entrance of Craufurdland and back to Dean Counrtypark.</desc>
    <type>hikingTourTrail</type>
